    "title": "Math: Fractions of one whole",
    "objectiveTitle": "同一个整体的分数",
    "lessonTitle": "分数与等份",
    "teachingItems": [
      {
        "primary": "A fraction describes equal-sized parts of one whole. One half means taking one of two equal parts. In four equal parts, one is 1/4 and three are 3/4.",
        "secondary": "分数表示一个整体被平均分后的份数。一半就是两个等份中的一份。四等份中的一份是 1/4，三份是 3/4。"
      },
      {
        "primary": "Two fourths and one half are equal parts of the same-sized whole, so 2/4 = 1/2. One quarter of 12 is 3 because 12 ÷ 4 = 3.",
        "secondary": "同一个整体的 2/4 与 1/2 一样大，即 2/4 = 1/2。12 的 1/4 是 3，因为 12 ÷ 4 = 3。"
      }
    ],
